==Other signs==
Direction/distance signs have dark green backgrounds and white text for [[Expressways of Okaiken|expressways]]. In urban areas and on [[National highways of Okaiken|national highways]], direction signs have dark blue backgrounds. The signs are normally written in Sanese and Mercian
.
